            <td>Enterprise application</td>
            <td>Result-to-Action Authorization required for declared action</td>
            <td>Provider OK is not ALLOW for enterprise effect</td>
            <td>Application integration contract</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Return-path bypass</td>
            <td>Customer / network</td>
            <td>Result-to-Action on return / action path</td>
            <td>Hard stop when authorization is enforced; otherwise customer residual</td>
            <td>Deployment architecture</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>System Connector manipulation</td>
            <td>Optional System Connector</td>
            <td>Connector cannot evaluate controls or bypass fail-closed enforcement</td>
            <td>DENY when normalized context fails validation or trust checks</td>
            <td>Connector hardening and monitoring</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Misuse after authorized action</td>
            <td>Outside declared action / outside BeaconGuard path</td>
            <td>BeaconGuard authorizes declared action only</td>
            <td>Not a runtime permission bypass of BeaconGuard</td>
            <td>Customer application and operational controls</td>
